{"unit_id":"YooRarely__dsh-open-explorer#card-zh","repo":"YooRarely/dsh-open-explorer","commit":"d950a30adbf8e55b77d63d6b917d9ce44ab5d7e6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-open-explorer 是面向 DSH Web 的工作区目录打开插件。它在会话标题操作区加入文件夹按钮，并在工作区操作菜单中提供打开入口；插件根据当前会话关联的工作区或会话目录取得路径，再通过 Client Connection 的 Host RPC 请求运行 DSH 的主机打开该目录。菜单适配识别工作区菜单语义并在无法识别时保留标题按钮。适合希望从 DSH 快速定位项目文件夹的用户，使用时需要已有工作区或会话目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:56-65","client.js:327-349"]}
{"unit_id":"YooRarely__dsh-open-explorer#card-en","repo":"YooRarely/dsh-open-explorer","commit":"d950a30adbf8e55b77d63d6b917d9ce44ab5d7e6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-open-explorer adds a folder button to DSH Web and an action in the workspace menu. It finds the current workspace path and asks the DSH host to open it. The header button remains available if menu recognition stops working. Use it to reach project folders from a DSH session.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:56-65","client.js:327-349"]}
