{"unit_id":"YooRarely__dsh-open-explorer#feature-header-button","repo":"YooRarely/dsh-open-explorer","commit":"d950a30adbf8e55b77d63d6b917d9ce44ab5d7e6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-open-explorer 的功能「会话标题栏按钮」：在关联工作区或会话目录存在时显示文件夹按钮；点击后请求 DSH 主机打开该路径，并在请求失败时显示可重试状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:56-89","client.js:327-335"]}
{"unit_id":"YooRarely__dsh-open-explorer#feature-workspace-menu","repo":"YooRarely/dsh-open-explorer","commit":"d950a30adbf8e55b77d63d6b917d9ce44ab5d7e6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-open-explorer 的功能「工作区菜单入口」：在识别到工作区操作菜单后插入“在资源管理器中打开”菜单项；点击后请求主机打开对应工作区目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:183-189","client.js:245-295"]}
{"unit_id":"YooRarely__dsh-open-explorer#feature-host-open","repo":"YooRarely/dsh-open-explorer","commit":"d950a30adbf8e55b77d63d6b917d9ce44ab5d7e6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-open-explorer 的功能「调用主机打开目录」：通过 Client Connection 的 host.openPath RPC 将目录路径交给运行 DSH 的主机处理，并把 RPC 返回的失败转换为可见失败状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:327-335"]}
